  "instructions": [
    "heat the oven to 375f (190c).",
    "blanch the vine leaves in boiling water for 2 minutes, then rinse with cold water.",
    "cook the malfada and fregula pasta according to the package instructions, drain and set aside.",
    "in a large bowl, whisk together the olive oil, red wine vinegar, salt, and a pinch of black pepper.",
    "add the cherry tomatoes, garlic, and anchovies to the bowl and toss to combine.",
    "add the cooked pasta to the bowl and toss to combine.",
    "add the blanched vine leaves to the bowl and toss to combine.",
    "drizzle the extra virgin olive oil and lemon juice over the salad and toss to combine.",
    "sprinkle the grana padano cheese over the salad and serve immediately."
